#
# Failing control for math:TensorRankNonNegativeConstraint: a shape declares rank -1.
# The value is an integer and the shape declares no axis, so the integer-family
# profile, the axis-count law (no axis, no counted group), the positive-rank law (the
# rank is not above zero) and the index laws (no axis) are all satisfied; the negative
# rank is the only defect. Bound by ex:ecTensorRankNegative.
@prefix math: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/math/> .
@prefix ex:   <http://example.org/math/tensor-shape-controls/> .

ex:shape a math:TensorShape ; math:tensorRank -1 .
